---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="GSAP Quick Tips" filename="notes/gsap.htm">
  <p><a href={`${base}notes/`} class="back-link">← Back to Notes</a></p>

  <h1>GSAP Quick Tips</h1>

  <p><em>January 14, 2024</em></p>

  <hr />

  <p>Useful GSAP animation patterns I keep coming back to.</p>

  <h2>Stagger Animations</h2>

  <pre>gsap.from('.item', &#123;
  opacity: 0,
  y: 20,
  stagger: 0.1
&#125;);</pre>

  <h2>Timeline for Sequences</h2>

  <pre>const tl = gsap.timeline();
tl.from('.box1', &#123; x: -100 &#125;)
  .from('.box2', &#123; x: 100 &#125;, '-=0.3')
  .to('.box1', &#123; rotation: 360 &#125;);</pre>

  <h2>Quick Set (No Animation)</h2>

  <pre>gsap.set('.element', &#123; opacity: 0 &#125;);</pre>

  <hr />

  <div class="fp-nav-bar">
    <a href={`${base}notes/`} class="fp-nav-btn">◀ Back to Notes</a>
  </div>
</Layout>
